{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"An unrelated routinely skipped test causes passing evidence to be rejected, leaving verification requiring human intervention."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"boundary","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Candidate-controlled test output can forge coverage and cross the trust boundary into authoritative acceptance evidence."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Bun can run a different matching file while exact command matching incorrectly marks the requested test as verified."}]}